      "text": "{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R49/2013-A-SK1-23.02\",\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"page_total\": 13,\n    \"member_state\": \"Slovakia\"\n  },\n  \"issuing_authority\": {\n    \"name\": \"Slovak Legal Metrology (SLM)\"\n  },\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Water meter\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\n      \"QALCOSONIC W1\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Water meters type QALCOSONIC W1, produced in two designs (design A and design B). Section 4 lists the required markings: name or trademark of the manufacturer; type name; unit of measurement m³; year of manufacture; serial number; direction-of-flow arrow; flowrate Q3 and ratio Q3/Q1 indicated as (R) followed by the ratio value; maximum admissible pressure (MAP); temperature class; pressure-loss class (Δp); latest replacement date; environmental classification; installation sensitivity class; electromagnetic environmental class; flow profile sensitivity class; national type approval sign. Section 5 security measures: wire with seal securing the connection between upper cover and housing; meter casing imperceptibly closed; opening the sealed upper cover activates a safety button in the meter body and an error code appears on the display. Legible faceplate markings on the photographed meters include CE, M21, T30, QM15, R160 and the name AXIOMA. Sealing arrangements illustrated for DN15/DN20 (Fig. 2a), DN25/DN32 (Fig. 2b) and DN40 (Fig. 2c).\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": \"QALCOSONIC W1\",\n    \"models\": [\n      {\n        \"model_id\": \"design A\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"model_id\": \"design B\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"characteristics\": {\n    \"type_level\": {\n      \"temperature_class\": {\n        \"value\": \"T30\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"unit_id\": null,\n        \"footnote_markers\": []\n      },\n      \"ratio_q3_over_q1\": {\n        \"value\": 160,\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"unit_id\": null,\n        \"footnote_markers\": []\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"revision_history\": [\n    {\n      \"revision\": \"3\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"id\": \"R49\",\n    \"edition\": 2013,\n    \"scheme\": \"A\"\n  }\n}"
